1
00:00:00,641 --> 00:00:02,641
(sniffles)
You're right.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:05,513
(Bernadette:)Now where did we land
on my bathroom?

3
00:00:08,783 --> 00:00:10,283
(door opening)

4
00:00:10,284 --> 00:00:11,684
(Sheldon:)Hey.

5
00:00:11,686 --> 00:00:12,956
(Sheldon:)Hello.

6
00:00:12,954 --> 00:00:14,354
(Leonard:)How come you're up so late?

7
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:16,225
(Sheldon:)I posted the last episode

8
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:18,294
(Sheldon:)of Fun with Flags hours ago,

9
00:00:18,292 --> 00:00:20,792
(Sheldon:)and not a single person
cared enough to comment.

10
00:00:22,797 --> 00:00:25,127
(Sheldon:)All that effort for nothing.

11
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:27,133
(Leonard:)Mm. I know how you feel.

12
00:00:27,135 --> 00:00:29,865
(Leonard:)I spent the day throwing out
a man's entire career,

13
00:00:29,871 --> 00:00:31,671
(Leonard:)and all that's left is
an old bottle of champagne

14
00:00:31,672 --> 00:00:34,072
(Leonard:)and a naked lady pen
that Raj took

15
00:00:34,075 --> 00:00:36,505
(Leonard:)when he thought
no one was looking.

16
00:00:36,511 --> 00:00:39,411
(Sheldon:)It's not the same thing.

17
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:42,184
(Sheldon:)I don't think you know
how I feel at all.

18
00:00:42,183 --> 00:00:44,513
(Leonard:)Sad?

19
00:00:44,519 --> 00:00:47,549
(Sheldon:)Hmm. You do get me.

20
00:00:48,923 --> 00:00:50,923
(computer chimes)

21
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:52,725
(Sheldon:)Someone left a comment.

22
00:00:52,727 --> 00:00:54,157
(Leonard:)Yeah. What did they say?

23
00:00:54,162 --> 00:00:56,162
"Too bad your show is done.

24
00:00:56,164 --> 00:00:58,094
I kind of liked it."

25
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)Leonard, did you hear that?

